@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade Operations - Evidencia de ramas y publicaciones

actor "Desarrollador/a" as Developer
component "Rama Git main" as Main EZ_DEVOPS
component "GitHub Actions\npush to main" as PushCi EZ_DEVOPS
component "GitHub Actions\npull_request to main" as PrCi EZ_DEVOPS
component "Backend Maven verify" as Verify EZ_BACKEND
component "Job de despliegue/release\nno encontrado" as DeployMissing EZ_RISK
component "Estrategia de release versionado\nno documentada en el repo" as ReleaseMissing EZ_RISK

Developer --> Main : push
Developer --> PrCi : abre PR hacia main
Main --> PushCi
PushCi --> Verify
PrCi --> Verify
Verify ..> DeployMissing : sin paso posterior de despliegue
Verify ..> ReleaseMissing : sin flujo declarado de artefacto de release

note bottom
Evidencia: ../.github/workflows/maven.yml.
Solo se pueden inferir triggers sobre la rama main. No hay entornos staging/prod,
flujo de release por tag ni documento de politica de ramas.
end note

@enduml
